+
+## Library-only installation
+
+The `TABULATE_INSTALL=lib-only` option described in the README predates the current `flit_scm` packaging configuration. `pyproject.toml` declares the `tabulate` console script unconditionally, so installing the package always installs the executable. If you only need the Python library, install the package normally and ignore the console script.
